["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"132. 对星海图创始人高继扬的3小时访谈：鲶鱼、曾国藩、Waymo与Momenta的两面、一只狼与许华哲的离开 VLA data recipe sim-to-real gap domain transfer NRE 加 License\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-02-13-zhangxiaojun-机器人行业不浪漫-链条太长-人得把头伸到土里/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0f499571a7c864df-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">3:04:52</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0213</span></div>\n<h2>机器人行业不浪漫：链条太长，人得把头伸到土里</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">星海图创始人高继扬说，机器人创业的竞争是六边形：整机、供应链、数据、模型、渠道、终端，算法传播周期只有两三个月，壁垒最小。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">具身智能</span><span class=\"tag\">机器人</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"131. 印奇出任阶跃星辰董事长的访谈：聪明人的诱惑、取舍、超长链路残酷淘汰赛、阶跃函数和超多元方程 VLA foundation model edge MVP\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-01-26-zhangxiaojun-印奇出任阶跃星辰董事长-基模公司做2b和纯2c都不成立/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ae74dec7a752a3fc-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">2:01:27</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0126</span></div>\n<h2>印奇出任阶跃星辰董事长：基模公司做2B和纯2C都不成立</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">基模一年至少烧30亿人民币、要维持三到五年，所以做2B或纯C端软件都算不过账；阶跃的赌注是基模加终端，用软硬一体换一张上牌桌的资格。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">大模型</span><span class=\"tag\">商业化</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"130. 张月光创业两年首次访谈：妙鸭不是AI Native产品、流程到上下文设计、One Way Door和乙女游戏 AI Native One Way Door Live2D Context Engineering Q-Time / Save Time\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-01-22-zhangxiaojun-妙鸭不是-ai-native-产品-它只是把-ai-用好的互联网产品/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/84b4403959914648-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">3:14:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0122</span></div>\n<h2>妙鸭不是 AI Native 产品：它只是把 AI 用好的互联网产品</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">张月光复盘两年创业：妙鸭靠限制用户自由度换取稳定效果，本质是互联网产品思维；AI Native 产品要换成面向 context 的设计，而单向门产品才是他愿意押上全部身家的东西。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 产品</span><span class=\"tag\">创业</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"129. 全球大模型第一股的上市访谈，和智谱CEO张鹏聊：敢问路在何方？ MAS Test Time Scaling VLA\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-01-08-zhangxiaojun-全球大模型第一股上市了-张鹏说中国-ai-没有泡沫/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/96bd8c162ef0083d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">2:26:39</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0108</span></div>\n<h2>全球大模型第一股上市了，张鹏说中国 AI 没有泡沫</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美国资本市场可能有泡沫，中国不存在——中国投 AI 的钱只有美国的二十几分之一，远远不够。张鹏的逻辑是：离 AGI 还远、钱还不够，就更得投，不投它不会自然发生。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">大模型</span><span class=\"tag\">开源</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"128. Manus决定出售前最后的访谈：啊，这奇幻的2025年漂流啊… compaction awareness Remote Labor Index TIR RLVR latent reasoning\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-12-30-zhangxiaojun-manus-决定出售前最后访谈-ai-没有蛮荒期-因为没新平台/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4744d9a1060b8431-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">3:31:17</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1230</span></div>\n<h2>Manus 决定出售前最后访谈：AI 没有蛮荒期，因为没新平台</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">移动互联网的蛮荒期来自硬件换代，桌面到手机让巨头和个人开发者众生平等；AI 技术突破更大，却没有出现全新平台，所以巨头、创业公司、个人开发者反应一样快，蛮荒期不存在。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>20</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI Agent</span><span class=\"tag\">Manus</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"127. 大模型季报跨年对谈：和广密预言一场AI War、两大联盟和第三个范式Online Learning Online Learning Agentic Web Neo Labs Credit Assignment\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-12-24-zhangxiaojun-ai不是泡沫-是巨头砸光最后一分钱也不下牌桌的战争/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a70c3ff97f6ae434-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:18:02</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1224</span></div>\n<h2>AI不是泡沫，是巨头砸光最后一分钱也不下牌桌的战争</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">所谓 AI 泡沫，是拿商业回报算出来的账；巨头把它当成新的国防或核武器，算的是被颠覆的风险——所以宁可砸光最后一分钱，也不轻易下牌桌。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">大模型</span><span class=\"tag\">AGI</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"126. 和红杉郑庆生聊：经济史的流量革命、人类行为模式的不可预期，与创始人性格 双边网络效应 PMF 幸存者偏差\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-12-21-zhangxiaojun-ai-时代的网络没有自然垄断-边际成本不趋近于零/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/49045e811e1dea1b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:43:06</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1221</span></div>\n<h2>AI 时代的网络没有自然垄断，边际成本不趋近于零</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">互联网产品是巨大的城镇，边际成本趋近于零所以赢家通吃；AI 每多一个用户就多一份 token 成本，这个差别会改写流量节点的商业设计。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 投资</span><span class=\"tag\">流量</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"125. Freda的投资札记第1集：下注OpenAI、Robinhood往事，美国资本坏小孩、算盘与泡沫 Crossover Scaling Law Single GM Prediction Market Agentic Commerce Neo Labs\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-12-16-zhangxiaojun-openai-的商业模式是负向滚雪球-越烧越亏/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f93330d12f4107e9-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:24:26</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1216</span></div>\n<h2>OpenAI 的商业模式是负向滚雪球，越烧越亏</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">模型公司每年要拿上一年的训练成本乘以十去烧下一代模型，收入却只按上一年的两倍回收，加 2 减 10，现金流年年更负。只有停止烧钱那天，利润表才会突然好看。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">OpenAI</span><span class=\"tag\">Anthropic</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"124. 雨森的创投观察第1集：2026年预期、The Year of R、回调、我们如何下注 Year of R New Labs proactive agent Remote Labor Index OOD\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-12-13-zhangxiaojun-2026-是回报之年-模型没有秘密-应用才有护城河/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9da6aa992d11d172-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">3:23:03</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1213</span></div>\n<h2>2026 是回报之年：模型没有秘密，应用才有护城河</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">模型能力进步在放缓，中国开源模型把差距压到 6-12 个月，API 生意没有垄断性壁垒；真正值钱的是模型之外那层 context、工具和环境。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 投资</span><span class=\"tag\">模型护城河</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"123. 对ONE2X创始人王冠3小时访谈：生成系统、没有中间商赚差价、内容平台的权力分配 DSL System 1 / System 2 Context Engineering prosumer reward function\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-12-12-zhangxiaojun-ai-时代的公司最终都是生成系统公司-中间商会被干掉/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/892c212740d3e240-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">3:42:54</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1212</span></div>\n<h2>AI 时代的公司最终都是生成系统公司，中间商会被干掉</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">互联网平台靠分配权剥削生产端，同样的内容不同人发量不一样，说明分配机制失效。生成系统把分配内化，直接连接需求和生产，产销合一。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">生成系统</span><span class=\"tag\">数据飞轮</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"122. 朱啸虎现实主义故事的第三次连载：人工智能的盛筵与泡泡 Club Deal Dark Fiber SOTA Token\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-12-09-zhangxiaojun-ai-三年内看不到泡沫-但-vc-共识太集中才是真风险/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0b9b598ea05f613e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">48:00</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1209</span></div>\n<h2>AI 三年内看不到泡沫，但 VC 共识太集中才是真风险</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">朱啸虎说泡沫论是二级市场投资人在故意引导回调，真正的问题是一级市场每个项目都成了 Club Deal，GP 赚不了大钱、LP 也不开心。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 泡沫</span><span class=\"tag\">风险投资</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"121. 对DeepMind谭捷的访谈：机器人、跨本体、世界模型、Gemini Robotics 1.5和Google VLA cross embodiment transfer motion transfer sim to real egocentric video embodiment gap\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-11-28-zhangxiaojun-机器人最大的瓶颈不是算法-是数据/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/946401201b99ef46-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">2:06:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1128</span></div>\n<h2>机器人最大的瓶颈不是算法，是数据</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">谭捷在 Google DeepMind 做了十年机器人，他的判断是：机器人基座模型至今还不是独立学科，只是多模态大模型的微调；真正的瓶颈是数据，而摇操采数据不是终局。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">机器人</span><span class=\"tag\">具身智能</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"120. 小鹏新上任的刘先明首次访谈：Language是毒药、拆掉L、简单即美、换帅、小鹏的AI转型 VLA Latent COT scaling Physical AI\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-11-18-zhangxiaojun-小鹏拆掉语言模型-language-是毒药-简单即美/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1e2c3717dde66c36-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:48:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1118</span></div>\n<h2>小鹏拆掉语言模型：Language 是毒药，简单即美</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">小鹏自动驾驶新负责人刘先明把 VLA 里的 Language 拆掉，用 27 万到 30 万小时纯视觉数据直接输出控制信号，因为 Language 是离散的、低效的，会成为数据规模化的瓶颈。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">自动驾驶</span><span class=\"tag\">VLA</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"119. Kimi Linear、Minimax M2？和杨松琳考古算法变种史，并预演未来架构改进方案 Linear Attention KDA Delta Rule Sparse Attention Sliding Window Attention Scaling Ladder\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-11-03-zhangxiaojun-纯线性注意力不-work-3-比-1-混合才是共识/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8af4f82306c1b043-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:43:25</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1103</span></div>\n<h2>纯线性注意力不 work，3 比 1 混合才是共识</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">纯 Linear Attention 有根本缺陷，下限无保证；Kimi、千问都收敛到每 3 层线性插 1 层全局注意力，而 MiniMax 从 M1 退回 Full Attention 是因为评测漏了多跳推理。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>2</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">线性注意力</span><span class=\"tag\">模型架构</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"118. 对李想的第二次3小时访谈：CEO大模型、MoE、梁文锋、VLA、能量、记忆、对抗人性、亲密关系、人类的智慧 VLA MoE AgentOS RLHF 世界模型\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-10-30-zhangxiaojun-李想-通用-agent-五年内不会出现-只会先有-agentos/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1a2c96d240eb08aa-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">2:46:22</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1030</span></div>\n<h2>李想：通用 agent 五年内不会出现，只会先有 agentOS</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">李想判断通用 agent 五年内不会出现，真正会出现的是 agentOS——各专业在上面开发自己的专业 agent。因为生产工具必须能行动、能替代专业工作，而不是给个建议。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">自动驾驶</span><span class=\"tag\">VLA</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"117. 开源一段论文探索之旅：模型范式、Infra和数据、语言、多模态的完整变迁史 MFU MOE COT LoRA RLHF 光流\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-10-28-zhangxiaojun-模型是炼油厂-第一阶段的赢家不是最后的赢家/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a079c1aa86947eb7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">4:22:37</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1028</span></div>\n<h2>模型是炼油厂：第一阶段的赢家不是最后的赢家</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">商业史上第一波跑出来的公司几乎从不是下个阶段的赢家。模型公司是提炼基础油的炼油厂，值钱的是化工厂和汽车公司。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">论文精读</span><span class=\"tag\">模型范式</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"116. 吴明辉口述19年史：漫长的沉浮、痛苦急转、企业级Agentic Model、现实世界的数值游戏、IPO agentic model pass@1 MOA context\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-10-09-zhangxiaojun-模型是炼油厂-值钱的是化工厂和汽车公司/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bb4fc975caeda4bd-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">3:47:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1009</span></div>\n<h2>模型是炼油厂，值钱的是化工厂和汽车公司</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">基础模型只要有两家以上就不可能赚钱，会像电价一样被卷成电费；真正的壁垒是别人没存下来的 context 数据，以及大厂因为晋升机制永远做不了的最后一公里。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">企业级AI</span><span class=\"tag\">数据壁垒</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"115. 对OpenAI姚顺雨3小时访谈：6年Agent研究、人与系统、吞噬的边界、既单极又多元的世界 pass@k pass^k affordance memory hierarchy intrinsic reward\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-09-11-zhangxiaojun-ai-下半场-通用方法已经有了-难的是找任务/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cfbf7de74c2135f3-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">2:31:32</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0911</span></div>\n<h2>AI 下半场：通用方法已经有了，难的是找任务</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">姚顺雨说 AI 主线已从「造武器」进入「选战场」——方法终于通用了，但真正的瓶颈不是推理能力，而是模型拿不到人脑子里的 context。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Agent</span><span class=\"tag\">强化学习</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"114. 与殷一、欧迪聊聊萨洛蒙：中国意外的增长阀门、小众越野跑与少女故事 the winning moments OOTD repeat traffic\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-09-06-zhangxiaojun-越野跑核心人群十年没变-萨洛蒙靠女性破了圈/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2776969c0511e305-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:18:27</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0906</span></div>\n<h2>越野跑核心人群十年没变，萨洛蒙靠女性破了圈</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">中国越野跑核心人群十年前十万人，今年还是十万人，区别是老了十岁。萨洛蒙没丢专业线，靠女性拉新把会员从十万做到八百万。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">消费品牌</span><span class=\"tag\">户外运动</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"113. 和杨植麟时隔1年的对话：K2、Agentic LLM、缸中之脑和“站在无限的开端” Muon optimizer test time scaling brain in a vat reward hacking curriculum learning\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-08-27-zhangxiaojun-管公司像训模型-sft-太多-团队就没有创造力了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b659eec041fc4bbc-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:41:13</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0827</span></div>\n<h2>管公司像训模型：SFT 太多，团队就没有创造力了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Tim 天天跟杨植麟讲：管理要用 RL 的方式，不是 SFT。SFT 是直接告诉人该怎么做，太多，人就没有主观能动性；RL 只给奖励，但奖励定义不好，全队都会去 hack 它。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">大模型</span><span class=\"tag\">Agent</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"112. 和广密聊大模型季报：分化与收敛、全家桶与垂直整合、L4体验与挖矿窗口 Reward Hacking L4 体验 全家桶 垂直整合 DPI\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-08-18-zhangxiaojun-模型公司是挖矿的-产品公司是炼矿的/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dba5cdc7209fbd97-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:09:11</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0818</span></div>\n<h2>模型公司是挖矿的，产品公司是炼矿的</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">最好的模型拿走了最大的流量和收入，但挖矿的窗口正在缩短：从两年到九个月再到三四个月。基础模型公司开始端到端做 Agent，应用公司的成本劣势是结构性的。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">大模型</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 投资</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"111. 李一帆口述激光雷达11年创业史：你仔细想行业的机会来自哪？是国家、民族的机会 ASIC ITC POC Robotaxi Tier 1\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-08-07-zhangxiaojun-激光雷达降价-99-5-靠的不是上量而是设计/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2a07079c1963cee2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">3:08:32</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0807</span></div>\n<h2>激光雷达降价 99.5%，靠的不是上量而是设计</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">硬件的降本不来自规模，来自设计能力：把几十万一台的激光雷达做进芯片，才可能从功能件变成安全件，最后变成标配。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">激光雷达</span><span class=\"tag\">硬科技创业</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"110. 逐段讲解Kimi K2报告并对照ChatGPT Agent、Qwen3-Coder等：“系统工程的力量” MCP KV Cache verifiable reward reward hacking persona partial rollout\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-07-30-zhangxiaojun-kimi-k2-把配方全公开了-但复现它仍是手艺活/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4f4a70954860f9ed-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">2:20:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0730</span></div>\n<h2>Kimi K2 把配方全公开了，但复现它仍是手艺活</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Kimi K2 报告把数据合成、可验证奖励、RL 基础设施的 recipe 全写出来了，但每个 prompt、每个参数都要调稳，本质是系统工程而非 idea。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Agent</span><span class=\"tag\">Kimi K2</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"109. 机器人遭遇数据荒？与谢晨聊：仿真与合成数据、Meta天价收购和Alexandr Wang Sim2Real Real2Sim data pyramid cross embodiment acquihire scaling law moment\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-07-15-zhangxiaojun-仿真不等于仿真器-机器人数据荒里最赚钱的是原料商/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/17864fa8278d8825-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:41:09</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0715</span></div>\n<h2>仿真不等于仿真器：机器人数据荒里最赚钱的是原料商</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">具身智能还在 GPT-1 阶段，没找到 scaling law 的配方。真正卡住行业的是高质量物理资产和场景，而不是仿真器——所以做仿真器的人反而最不赚钱。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">具身智能</span><span class=\"tag\">合成数据</span>\n</div></div></a>"]